## 5. Extract-patterns checklist

### Evidence gate

- [ ] `## Evidence` section filled with overall status + discovery method
- [ ] Canonical code blocks verbatim from cited `file:line`
- [ ] "Where used" references confirmed via grep
- [ ] Variations cite distinct files (no duplicates)
- [ ] >=50% of pattern references are `[verified]`

### Coverage

- [ ] At least 5 patterns documented (8-12 ideal)
- [ ] Each pattern has canonical code snippet (5-20 lines)
- [ ] Each pattern has Use case / AVOID / How-to-apply sections
- [ ] All file references verified real (file:line)
- [ ] Quality + effort scored per pair
- [ ] Anti-portability section populated
- [ ] File committed to `dissects/<system>/extract/patterns.md`
- [ ] Cross-link from `wiki/index.md`